posting	Bank account	-300000
posting	Suppliers	300000
entry	2011-03-01	The material is sold to customer 1 for 5,000
posting	Sales	-500000
posting	Customer 1	500000
entry	2011-03-31	Customer 1 pays
posting	Customer 1	-500000
posting	Bank account	500000
entry	2011-11-20	More material bought for 2,000, paid at once
posting	Bank account	-200000
posting	Purchases	200000
